        "title": "ҚР Ғылым және жоғары білім министрлігі",
        "handle": "gylym_jogary_bilim",
        "verified": false,
        "avatar": "https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/bMc_1ll8JFxJ4G3SZBlJKEf_dKl_ABLxDpomfDzFHulGJm8aukr_IMhUzPJfB4k0LLTBBb9de6nnT0TEl5hRcTI3Tqhda4mHJtxKJonWWSXyieFhUW1LNi0Av960VamIE4vqWV8DMk9wWvJXEqNjOYMoz_c6t6toRbrGCx11I5XqqA4W-lDGubMeTiuuXIOb6LDAQUbACIvt-4Dwivu0zneajtKxap_PlwIfNf2hCaXJrKicAJgE1huxVxIeaP7kOp_VOZk6hsTCvX6Anao7Wf-5dZ9X_B0Pjqtpaqz6JlRucGnktatPVQ3PWMFkIQtcgNZPU8PgnQSrpxMIOJs96g.jpg"
